          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balak said unto him, Come, I pray thee, with me unto another place, from whence thou mayest see them; thou shalt see but the utmost part of them, and shalt not see them all: and curse me them from thence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took him into the field of Zophim, to the top of Pisgah, and built seven altars, and offered up a bullock and a ram on every altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto Balak, Stand here by thy burnt-offering, while I meet ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yonder. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jehovah met Balaam, and put a word in his mouth, and said, Return unto Balak, and thus shalt thou speak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he came to him, and, lo, he was standing by his burnt-offering, and the princes of Moab with him. And Balak said unto him, What hath Jehovah spoken? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took up his parable, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balak said unto Balaam, Come now, I will take thee unto another place; peradventure it will please God that thou mayest curse me them from thence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balak took Balaam unto the top of Peor, that looketh down upon the desert. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balaam said unto Balak, Build me here seven altars, and prepare me here seven bullocks and seven rams. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Balak did as Balaam had said, and offered up a bullock and a ram on every altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
